      <title>FirefUXSS: Universal XSS in Firefox Focus for iOS via Redirect-Scheme Validation Race Condition</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/poc-archive/pocs/web/2026-06-08_firefox-focus-ios-uxss-redirect-scheme-race-condition/</link>
